# Fixture for spec_library/block_model/native_codegen.feature (Phase 19,
# extended for Phase 18's new BuildList/generic-CallHost opcodes).
# Confirms both direct passthroughs actually work, not just compile:
# BuildList itself, and CallHost for two names ("list_len", via
# list_len(xs); "list_get", via indexing xs[1]) that happen to fall
# within codegen_x64.patlang's own OS-boundary allowlist. NOT a claim
# that every possible CallHost name works natively -- see
# native_codegen.patlang's own header note on that passthrough.

make a function called start returns r
  let xs = [10, 20, 30]
  print(list_len(xs))
  print(xs[1])
end
